CHANGES MADE
================================================================================

Stapler is a modernized and significantly refactored version of blender-mcp:

1. Complete architectural redesign with modular structure
2. Migration to official Python MCP SDK patterns
3. Full uv package manager integration
4. Python 3.13+ features and modern type hints
5. Removed all external service integrations (PolyHaven, Hyper3D, Sketchfab)
6. Focus on core Blender functionality only (4 essential tools)
7. Simplified Blender addon (~78% code reduction)
8. Improved error handling and user feedback
9. Updated to Blender 4.5+ API patterns

Approximately 71% of the original codebase was removed or completely rewritten.

